# Environment Variables — Cloud FinOps Scanner
# -----------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit .env to git — it is in .gitignore.
# On Render.com / Railway / Fly.io, set these in the platform's
# "Environment Variables" dashboard instead of using a .env file.

# ── SMTP (Email Reports) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Mailtrap sandbox (dev/testing):
SMTP_HOST=sandbox.smtp.mailtrap.io
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=your-mailtrap-username
SMTP_PASS=your-mailtrap-password

# Gmail (production) — use App Password, never account password:
# SMTP_HOST=smtp.gmail.com
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=yourapp@gmail.com
# SMTP_PASS=your-16-char-app-password

# ── Session Security ─────────────────────────────────────────────
# Increase for production (default 3600 = 60 min):
# SESSION_TTL_SECONDS=3600

# ── AWS (optional — users supply via UI, these are fallback) ─────
# AWS_DEFAULT_REGION=us-east-1
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
